.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.auto.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars.json
secrets.tfvars
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# The devcontainer/setup branch's root .gitignore (once merged into main)
# adds a bare `.terraform.lock.hcl` pattern with no path prefix, which would
# match this file here too and silently stop it from being tracked —
# unintentional, since this file is deliberately committed for reproducible
# provider versions (see providers.tf/CHANGELOG.md entry 4). Un-ignore it
# explicitly, regardless of merge order.
!.terraform.lock.hcl
